1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,278
Electrons are jumping straight from zinc atoms to copper ions, and all that energy is wasted as heat.

2
00:00:07,278 --> 00:00:11,289
What if we could make those electrons travel through a wire instead?

3
00:00:11,289 --> 00:00:13,606
Then the same reaction would light a bulb.

4
00:00:13,606 --> 00:00:19,166
That is the whole idea of a battery, and by the end of this lesson, we will build one.

